{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0e0829451014a6cbd00d03da3be23076b29e5dc7b0684c714d26d6986e4caba9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_44ab6640b045f3339a73c36877fe0039a3b017dfaca990398da448bfd382596f"],"source_ids":["src_4f2074962ebb5915bc125c5e1cf21b04"],"text":"The system implements checkpoint resume logic: rerunning the same command after an interruption continues from where it left off, clearing outputs of half-finished tasks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0f46e5e1bf9353cab532a97f3b9e2ba8657ea21221e2b1e0e73d11fe3de89fce","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7da9e8067cf1600f05966835edb63d26c5007cb410274309a71f3cc9a37e8b2d"],"source_ids":["src_4f2074962ebb5915bc125c5e1cf21b04"],"text":"The CLI supports per-role model overrides (e.g., --code-reviewer-model, --domain-expert-model, --statistician-model, --planning-model) that override the global --model and --api settings.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_42f4c4d8f12ac16be3ef03f265ead00eb322d28c3274ea2599890b989aee8708","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_05122eddb587cc6ece313973e2afa17afa36129d67890b157d6633bdae43f6be"],"source_ids":["src_4f2074962ebb5915bc125c5e1cf21b04"],"text":"The framework provides a typed messaging communication protocol for code-driven analysis, a notebook-style workflow where agents plan, write, execute, debug, and backtrack, and customizable agent roles.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_47e3b0dc79dc4d57a86823b73e2e012122499bba756bfd64f69d04b2d641e17e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d74f4a56ac6755668afca83004bbfec6da718ed25dd41f87ac152529269abcc3"],"source_ids":["src_4f2074962ebb5915bc125c5e1cf21b04"],"text":"The stated design philosophy balances controllability of traditional workflows with autonomous-agent flexibility, favoring minimal encapsulation for easier agent experiments.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4f7bfd89681142653de527c61693108beb18bc981a03f754888cc3f2f6abaad2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_00a252a18bd2e2ba8e1841f6ee0944ad8866351dd6c5bb100e5a688b5205196e","slc_2bb7207d1ade831b92a0f01e24ec5696c32aca0686ec206545f0cfa46ecbac77","slc_4c4272051beab23ebc443ae0bb8aeba141f21496db5563519ea88506f0cd8c52","slc_6690ce3e049c3e7dbbed689b6ae3455b3bb9e08015d2e17535300590179b6049","slc_c4b93bfcda9aa512541b468b8c1a1f41fd12678ad0f5702a30e4182ee719f93e"],"source_ids":["src_4f2074962ebb5915bc125c5e1cf21b04"],"text":"Setup involves downloading ~42 GB of GenoTEX input data, validating it with download/validator.py, creating a Python 3.10 conda environment, and configuring API keys in a .env file copied from env.example.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7b8850f413fc37bf264e1435d556fd582f847e54c55f55691b2df5661a8efab5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1610a5af6cfb34c34c822d9251ab07adca9a0bacd36d5335e1903765321ad99f"],"source_ids":["src_2b8c055c275d54e5a0d175d2cc45d289"],"text":"requirements.txt lists LLM client libraries (openai, anthropic, google-generativeai, ollama) plus scientific packages such as numpy, pandas, scikit_learn, statsmodels, biopython, and sparse_lmm.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a275697a9eb050747bfcc4ab6acfbb6ef15f63d17660afd8fa6a30b067d0b5fc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_59c9950687888bbf4855e85e425eb7e17f5361b9c600afb2c046afac5510f394","slc_763bdb2abe976b06cc99f57836bc8f6f6810d09940437a9b9a49a6969d34a2f3"],"source_ids":["src_4f2074962ebb5915bc125c5e1cf21b04"],"text":"A full benchmark run over all 1,384 GenoTEX trait-condition pairs is estimated at 3-5 days and $300+ in API cost; experiments require up to 20K input tokens, relevant for local GPU deployment.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a7a0151c5f6c5f731e944a315ef1d975a2c9f9f9dad5bf9a5f3890fb2e7c69c4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_022e0eefc4bf0f4ff38ed540f18f682e33f27fbbe615cf4771c2459b930f5dd8","slc_24d71ea747b328b57d7682ac2416cb71f98c8901988d2845007a21bd455e70c6","slc_7eb85f57777b3f274c9fb22be9a5db1977c4e00ba5dea9dcfe6767474b4b55ff"],"source_ids":["src_4f2074962ebb5915bc125c5e1cf21b04"],"text":"The repository contains two main components: a general multi-agent framework for automating scientific workflows, and a specialized GenoMAS implementation for gene expression analysis.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d1a14f265dd464dde2a720b79002c411e4ce2e1e244cb0117a120bb3f3f4c993","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13b8f931fc25ff3f1d5c8cc1f6fcd624b0d1cd81c5d2a88e5089bb604cd4e324","slc_41aa7a29dc47ff304268c2dc5e37b5f2e990518b6c7e72a625d9e4498b917ba2","slc_922240abf31379385772f2babe0a07688be73fa5a1f90cfc29419bf97e079534","slc_da5f86426b664fadbb0ba200f4bad8c9dc846e45a69aa704bb289c83925a3090"],"source_ids":["src_4f2074962ebb5915bc125c5e1cf21b04"],"text":"An --generate-action-units mode generates Action Unit prompts from agent guidelines, optionally pausing for manual editing, with a --non-interactive variant for automated pipelines.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d90d582e773bc9e5e0074062eb369753ce35b515820fe314c80bb4cd8878e7de","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_781cc16b4474f47020fc9a3de9625ee2be96a5dbd9bd3a72265b6cfcfc6d5b97"],"source_ids":["src_4f2074962ebb5915bc125c5e1cf21b04"],"text":"The README reports a 60.38% F1 score on the GenoTEX benchmark, claimed to substantially outperform open-domain and generic biomedical agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e27c3ba7837f16d2b6bd636480076c05a1a54f9e9fc23fb06d57219e45365ecc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_29fa96184a1d2455dd1e4d653c494b8893a4c61bcbf319ebdbf65e792e53250f","slc_3f909cf918437c5db349e60cb0b1912bd9c9420384fb7cd1dd96865a1b93ccaa","slc_5b1a34e102bd31513eff566aa3b4439e72056dc1fdbe3b17bdfda810636401d1"],"source_ids":["src_4f2074962ebb5915bc125c5e1cf21b04"],"text":"A --parallel-mode cohorts option with --max-workers enables concurrent cohort preprocessing, reducing wall-clock time, though large worker counts may hit API rate limits.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f9aee05364d355991297de85cc3f3b6231116a88070ade4eaa675d47ecd00f2d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"liu-hy/genomas@d6365a700794 snapshot 5c67da614f29c857","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_781cc16b4474f47020fc9a3de9625ee2be96a5dbd9bd3a72265b6cfcfc6d5b97"],"source_ids":["src_4f2074962ebb5915bc125c5e1cf21b04"],"text":"GenoMAS analyzes transcriptomic datasets from GEO and TCGA to identify trait-related genes while accounting for confounders.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:06:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e0f6dd7501964e6d9a40c2ad2a7c96ae"}
